  m_text: 'CloSim is not made by, affiliated with, or meant to replace the MoSim
    team or Cascade Studios. The original MoSim Builder base belongs to them, and
    this project would not exist without their work.


    I made CloSim because
    I wanted to combine the awesome work the community has made and make builder
    robots easy for anyone to play with, even if they do not have much computer or
    modding experience.


    CloSim is not supposed to be realistic. It is not trying
    to be a serious simulator. It does not replace real drive pracitce!'
